---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Ecosistema | SportDharma Ecosystem">
  <section class="py-20 px-6 bg-surface-alt transition-colors duration-300">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        
        <!-- Tarjeta Manifiesto -->
        <div class="group block">
          <a href="/manifiesto" class="block">
            <div class="border border-white/10 dark:border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-[#E8530E]/30 dark:hover:border-orange-500/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(232,83,14,0.1)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 h-full cursor-pointer bg-transparent">
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 h-full">
                <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
                  <p class="text-[#E8530E] dark:text-orange-500 font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">MANIFIESTO</p>
                  <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-3 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] dark:group-hover:text-orange-500 transition-colors">Así nació SportDharma Ecosystem</h3>
                  <p class="text-ink-soft leading-relaxed text-sm">De los libros de la infancia a la vuelta al mundo en bicicleta. Del budismo a la IA. Una búsqueda de propósito que se transformó en infraestructura libre para deportistas.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-3">
                  <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-white/10 h-[140px]">
                    <img src="/manifiesto-grupo.jpg" alt="Cicloviajeros" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
                  </div>
                  <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-white/10 h-[140px]">
                    <img src="/manifiesto-laos.jpg" alt="Templo en Laos" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Tarjeta Qué Es -->
        <div class="group block">
          <a href="/ecosistema" class="block">
            <div class="border border-white/10 dark:border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-[#E8530E]/30 dark:hover:border-orange-500/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(232,83,14,0.1)] transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 h-full cursor-pointer bg-transparent">
              <p class="text-[#E8530E] dark:text-orange-500 font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">DESCUBRÍ</p>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-4 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] dark:group-hover:text-orange-500 transition-colors">¿Qué es SportDharma Ecosystem?</h3>
              <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 h-[280px]">
                <img src="/masf-captura-v2.png" alt="Interfaz del sistema MASF" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
